  "description": "It was discovered that the Murmur server in Mumble did not rate limit\ncertain client messages. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to\ncause Murmur to hang or crash, resulting in a denial of service. This\nupdate adds a message rate limit, which can be configured with the\nmessageburst and messagelimit settings.",
